 "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pgsty/mc/tarball/RELEASE.2026-09-01T00-00-00Z",
 "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pgsty/mc/zipball/RELEASE.2026-09-01T00-00-00Z",
 "body": "## Changelog\n* f5c5dc9fd146196526f5e0ff3254b7202aed6836 build: import the SILO package under its own module path\n* 2d5abc21cc971d1b241cd22200a0cb2f70618a46 chore: complete the AGPL notice on fork-authored files\n* c05da7b03c9148951511ece7dedac20b30eb1c30 chore: drop configuration for bots that are not installed\n* 2c33a4e28bdc0793fb6445a0711aa57cf26acf4f chore: ignore the local consumer-module review scratch directory\n* f484d0dbe709246d4b8b03a1b81aca7bc9cfebf6 ci: make a release prove its commit, and pin what it builds from\n* 9a3805da7f5a53f7eef8c4ea4e7b58f140322312 ci: make release retries tag-idempotent\n* 3674933279205b728ac38cb37a40bb74b551db4b ci: make the release gate provable and its claims true\n* 1445e88e797a296ebf319f3fb5d03addc76a9c69 ci: release only from a signed tag at the tip of main, verify exact provenance\n* a8e7eb4bc2458fd4c71fe56ba529f45939c703d3 ci: test main on push and stop dispatch runs cancelling each other\n* a6c14dab528e2846e6cd02653b6e85bfd77f74b4 ci: verify build provenance before repackaging archives into images\n* aa07b1c50e9abb2e7b8e29caaccc1441cbb85046 feat: add read-only object checksum verification\n* 4abbb3a938ab212402818e1675314b2131de9c61 feat: expose how much checksum verify actually verified\n* 7057705bf0bdb8504b5a3919ffcf4b76a5f72b80 fix: avoid double-closing S3 Select responses\n* d38412a3213ca2bf9784660fce2292e8e053dd63 fix: classify an SSE-C refusal with a key as a read error, keep policy and size messages clear\n* f1889395a947f2c99fa2cd942bc79c1686e9915c fix: close final credential and release verification gaps\n* bdc742afc3bb4ce1106f6ffb8c5ad1d1631d8830 fix: close the remaining --debug credential leaks\n* 45e5144921329f2d4066f9b4a1b0d12ab1a7a431 fix: fail --fail-on no-checksum when nothing was verified\n* c1358c428493c133345ac506a1a02ee9b5b06164 fix: force 0600 on rotated support artifacts too\n* 76b2e891ba9dc62f3e487dda01537ed2d675d861 fix: keep an unquoted DSN password whole and match auth schemes case-insensitively\n* 625713ce1849317366c3384dd2a6fe2ac83d953c fix: keep only the scheme of a signed header and scrub JSON structurally\n* 08244df9caf222905b5550eba5888ba2721d9874 fix: keep secrets out of error messages and traces\n* 59989f8a0ddf81d9a20329bd411ddf2bed7bbb6c fix: let svcacct set clear a policy again, report bad global flags once\n* 4b36b0a52b64f100c371a5c1317468a9de5fd8b1 fix: make credential redaction fail-closed and scrub final output\n* 1b39423078200861913ec88243e03fb6b4e78258 fix: preserve checksum output in pipelines\n* 81e27673da5a7a12726a0c4d4cbfccc2e4604eff fix: rebuild SigV4 traces from known fields and widen secret scrubbing\n* ec12b6434ed5f4f159933b6a8cd025b7b5923aad fix: redact admin trace output and register every credential ingress\n* f5b88ddd0285415852ea5f6d6280ea94a97e345b fix: redact the default admin trace and stop the shape sweep mangling prose\n* b291b539b2cc21bc7dd4ea0dec431ba4642e00bf fix: register a URL password as written, keep listing parameters visible in traces\n* 328efee1b06480d450c8935dbf46794462f82cf8 fix: register the password before the first separator of an unquoted DSN payload too\n* 915cfd9b4a4e560dc75a1f90af5c6bd29ebd9bfc fix: reject a malformed app-level global flag instead of ignoring it\n* a29b455e76036bf9490b47c76fe412dc746939bd fix: stop --debug from printing credentials\n* b75d28b597de779c1d8381f832bbd2f7b20821dc fix: stop checksum verify help from advertising the play alias\n* 30a7ea01de2f6273f6bc8daea4c8c53f6df662e3 fix: stop writing support artifacts world-readable\n* 712bf3a653c4a54dc265ea3c8627ad88fc86811d fix: use regular PUT for empty pipe input\n* 21210812e2bb618665859c99edfd64617b745d63 fix: validate policy writes strictly\n* 39983926da4b8a301eab602497d270840dcd861c fix: withhold SSE-C keys and credential URLs the parser rejects\n\n"
 },
