 "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pgsty/mc/zipball/RELEASE.2026-08-26T17-15-27Z",
 "body": "SILO MCLI compatibility correction built from commit 70a2950478e18e38eb68162317e4b5d34c6eb6d5.\n\nDependency routing:\n\n- github.com/minio/minio-go/v7 => github.com/pgsty/silo-go/v7 v7.3.1\n- github.com/minio/pkg/v3 => github.com/pgsty/silo-pkg/v3 v3.12.2\n- Compatible MinIO import paths are preserved.\n- The logical minio/pkg requirement is v3.6.1. This is the tested public compatibility floor for servers that embed mc or Console; standalone SILO builds still select silo-pkg v3.12.2 through the top-level replacement.\n- This release supersedes RELEASE.2026-08-26T00-00-00Z, whose logical v3.11.0 requirement could unnecessarily raise an embedding server module graph.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Go and controlled SILO functional CI: https://github.com/pgsty/mc/actions/runs/32993184715\n- Cross-compile: https://github.com/pgsty/mc/actions/runs/32993191001\n- Release pipeline: https://github.com/pgsty/mc/actions/runs/32994614044\n- Vulnerability scan: https://github.com/pgsty/mc/actions/runs/32993205414\n- Formal release build: https://github.com/pgsty/mc/actions/runs/32995345344\n- RPM assets are signed by key 9592A7BC7A682E7333376E09E7935D8DB9BD8B20 and their uploaded SHA256 digests were independently verified before publication."
